{"seq":1,"slug":"intellij-platform","title":"IntelliJ Platform 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/ide-extension-development/jetbrains-plugin/intellij-platform","wordCount":1175,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"intellij-platform-基础\">IntelliJ Platform 基础</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>IntelliJ Platform 是 JetBrains 全系列 IDE 的底层框架，包括 IntelliJ IDEA、WebStorm、PyCharm、GoLand 等产品都构建在这一平台之上。理解 IntelliJ Platform 的架构是开发高质量 JetBrains 插件的基础。</p>\n<p>平台采用<strong>组件-服务-扩展点</strong>三层架构，通过声明式的 <code>plugin.xml</code> 配置文件将插件功能注入到 IDE 运行时。与 VS Code 的事件驱动激活不同，IntelliJ Platform 使用**扩展点（Extension Point）**机制实现插件与宿主之间的解耦。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[IntelliJ Platform] --&gt; B[应用层 Application]&#10;    A --&gt; C[项目层 Project]&#10;    A --&gt; D[模块层 Module]&#10;    B --&gt; E[ApplicationService]&#10;    B --&gt; F[全局配置]&#10;    C --&gt; G[ProjectService]&#10;    C --&gt; H[项目配置]&#10;    D --&gt; I[ModuleService]&#10;    D --&gt; J[模块配置]&#10;    E --&gt; K[插件注册的扩展点]&#10;    G --&gt; K&#10;    I --&gt; K\">graph TD\n    A[IntelliJ Platform] --&gt; B[应用层 Application]\n    A --&gt; C[项目层 Project]\n    A --&gt; D[模块层 Module]\n    B --&gt; E[ApplicationService]\n    B --&gt; F[全局配置]\n    C --&gt; G[ProjectService]\n    C --&gt; H[项目配置]\n    D --&gt; I[ModuleService]\n    D --&gt; J[模块配置]\n    E --&gt; K[插件注册的扩展点]\n    G --&gt; K\n    I --&gt; K</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>IntelliJ Platform</th>\n<th>VS Code</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>插件入口</td>\n<td><code>plugin.xml</code> 声明式</td>\n<td><code>package.json</code> + <code>activate()</code></td>\n<td>IntelliJ 无需显式激活函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务注册</td>\n<td>Service 注解/XML</td>\n<td>Extension API</td>\n<td>IntelliJ 支持三级作用域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UI 框架</td>\n<td>Swing / JetBrains UI</td>\n<td>HTML/CSS Webview</td>\n<td>IntelliJ 使用原生 Java UI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩展机制</td>\n<td>Extension Point</td>\n<td>Contribution Point</td>\n<td>概念相似，实现不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语言模型</td>\n<td>PSI (Program Structure Interface)</td>\n<td>Language Server Protocol</td>\n<td>IntelliJ 内置完整语言模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构建工具</td>\n<td>Gradle (IntelliJ Plugin)</td>\n<td>webpack / esbuild</td>\n<td>IntelliJ 使用 JVM 生态工具链</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"plugin-xml-与声明式注册\">plugin.xml 与声明式注册</h2><p><code>plugin.xml</code> 是 IntelliJ 插件的核心配置文件，等价于 VS Code 的 <code>package.json</code>。它定义了插件的元信息、依赖关系、扩展点注册以及所有声明式配置。</p>\n<p>一个典型的 <code>plugin.xml</code> 结构如下：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"xml\" data-code=\"&lt;idea-plugin&gt;&#10;    &lt;id&gt;com.example.myplugin&lt;/id&gt;&#10;    &lt;name&gt;My Plugin&lt;/name&gt;&#10;    &lt;version&gt;1.0.0&lt;/version&gt;&#10;    &lt;vendor email=&quot;dev@example.com&quot; url=&quot;https://example.com&quot;&gt;Example&lt;/vendor&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;depends&gt;com.intellij.modules.platform&lt;/depends&gt;&#10;    &lt;depends&gt;com.intellij.modules.lang&lt;/depends&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;extensions defaultExtensionNs=&quot;com.intellij&quot;&gt;&#10;        &lt;applicationService&#10;            serviceInterface=&quot;com.example.MyService&quot;&#10;            serviceImplementation=&quot;com.example.MyServiceImpl&quot;/&gt;&#10;        &lt;projectService&#10;            serviceInterface=&quot;com.example.ProjectService&quot;&#10;            serviceImplementation=&quot;com.example.ProjectServiceImpl&quot;/&gt;&#10;        &lt;localInspection&#10;            language=&quot;JAVA&quot;&#10;            shortName=&quot;MyInspection&quot;&#10;            displayName=&quot;My Custom Inspection&quot;&#10;            groupName=&quot;My Plugin&quot;&#10;            implementationClass=&quot;com.example.MyInspection&quot;/&gt;&#10;    &lt;/extensions&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;actions&gt;&#10;        &lt;action id=&quot;MyPlugin.Action&quot;&#10;                class=&quot;com.example.MyAction&quot;&#10;                text=&quot;My Action&quot;&#10;                description=&quot;Performs my action&quot;&gt;&#10;            &lt;add-to-group group-id=&quot;EditorPopupMenu&quot; anchor=&quot;last&quot;/&gt;&#10;            &lt;keyboard-shortcut keymap=&quot;$default&quot; first-keystroke=&quot;ctrl alt M&quot;/&gt;&#10;        &lt;/action&gt;&#10;    &lt;/actions&gt;&#10;&lt;/idea-plugin&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">idea-plugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>com.example.myplugin&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>My Plugin&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>1.0.0&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">vendor</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> email</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dev@example.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://example.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>Example&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">vendor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">depends</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>com.intellij.modules.platform&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">depends</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">depends</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>com.intellij.modules.lang&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">depends</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">extensions</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defaultExtensionNs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"com.intellij\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">applicationService</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            serviceInterface</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"com.example.MyService\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            serviceImplementation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"com.example.MyServiceImpl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">projectService</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            serviceInterface</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"com.example.ProjectService\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            serviceImplementation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"com.example.ProjectServiceImpl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">localInspection</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            language</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"JAVA\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            shortName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MyInspection\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            displayName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"My Custom Inspection\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            groupName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"My Plugin\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            implementationClass</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"com.example.MyInspection\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">extensions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">actions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">action</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MyPlugin.Action\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">                class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"com.example.MyAction\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">                text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"My Action\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">                description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Performs my action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">add-to-group</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> group-id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EditorPopupMenu\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> anchor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"last\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">keyboard-shortcut</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> keymap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"$default\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> first-keystroke</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ctrl alt M\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">actions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">idea-plugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>&lt;depends&gt;</code> 标签声明插件对其他模块的依赖。<code>com.intellij.modules.platform</code> 是最基础的平台模块，几乎所有插件都需要依赖它。如果插件需要访问语言相关 API（如 PSI），还需依赖 <code>com.intellij.modules.lang</code>。</p>\n<p><code>&lt;extensions&gt;</code> 标签是核心区域，所有扩展点的注册都在此完成。<code>defaultExtensionNs</code> 指定默认命名空间，避免每个扩展都写完整路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"service-体系与作用域\">Service 体系与作用域</h2><p>IntelliJ Platform 的 Service 体系是插件状态管理的核心机制。Service 按作用域分为三个层级：Application 级、Project 级和 Module 级。</p>\n<p><strong>Application Service</strong> 在整个 IDE 生命周期内只有一个实例，适用于全局配置和跨项目共享状态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Service&#10;class MyApplicationService {&#10;    private val settings = mutableMapOf&lt;String, String&gt;()&#10;&#10;    fun getSetting(key: String): String? = settings[key]&#10;    fun setSetting(key: String, value: String) { settings[key] = value }&#10;&#10;    companion object {&#10;        fun getInstance(): MyApplicationService =&#10;            ApplicationManager.getApplication().getService(MyApplicationService::class.java)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class MyApplicationService {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val settings = mutableMapOf&#x3C;String, String>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun getSetting(key: String): String? = settings[key]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun setSetting(key: String, value: String) { settings[key] = value }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    companion object {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        fun getInstance(): MyApplicationService =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ApplicationManager.getApplication().getService(MyApplicationService::class.java)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Project Service</strong> 每个打开的项目各有一个实例，适用于项目相关的配置和缓存：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Service(Service.Level.PROJECT)&#10;class MyProjectService(private val project: Project) {&#10;    private val cache = ConcurrentHashMap&lt;String, Any&gt;()&#10;&#10;    fun getProjectName(): String = project.name&#10;    fun getCachedData(key: String): Any? = cache[key]&#10;&#10;    companion object {&#10;        fun getInstance(project: Project): MyProjectService =&#10;            project.getService(MyProjectService::class.java)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Service(Service.Level.PROJECT)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class MyProjectService(private val project: Project) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val cache = ConcurrentHashMap&#x3C;String, Any>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun getProjectName(): String = project.name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun getCachedData(key: String): Any? = cache[key]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    companion object {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        fun getInstance(project: Project): MyProjectService =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            project.getService(MyProjectService::class.java)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三级 Service 的选择策略如下：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A{数据是否与项目相关?} --&gt;|否| B[Application Service]&#10;    A --&gt;|是| C{是否需要模块粒度?}&#10;    C --&gt;|否| D[Project Service]&#10;    C --&gt;|是| E[Module Service]&#10;    B --&gt; F[全局单例]&#10;    D --&gt; G[每项目一个实例]&#10;    E --&gt; H[每模块一个实例]\">flowchart TD\n    A{数据是否与项目相关?} --&gt;|否| B[Application Service]\n    A --&gt;|是| C{是否需要模块粒度?}\n    C --&gt;|否| D[Project Service]\n    C --&gt;|是| E[Module Service]\n    B --&gt; F[全局单例]\n    D --&gt; G[每项目一个实例]\n    E --&gt; H[每模块一个实例]</pre><p>在现代 IntelliJ 插件开发中，<strong>轻量级 Service</strong>（Light Service）是推荐做法。使用 <code>@Service</code> 注解标记的类无需在 <code>plugin.xml</code> 中显式注册，平台会自动发现并管理其生命周期。</p>\n<h2 id=\"action-系统与用户交互\">Action 系统与用户交互</h2><p>Action 是 IntelliJ 插件与用户交互的主要方式。每个 Action 对应一个菜单项、工具栏按钮或键盘快捷键。Action 系统基于 <code>AnAction</code> 抽象类，包含两个核心方法：<code>update()</code> 控制可见性和启用状态，<code>actionPerformed()</code> 执行实际逻辑。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class MyAction : AnAction() {&#10;    override fun update(e: AnActionEvent) {&#10;        val project = e.project&#10;        val editor = e.getData(CommonDataKeys.EDITOR)&#10;        e.presentation.isEnabledAndVisible = project != null &amp;&amp; editor != null&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    override fun actionPerformed(e: AnActionEvent) {&#10;        val project = e.project ?: return&#10;        val editor = e.getData(CommonDataKeys.EDITOR) ?: return&#10;        val document = editor.document&#10;        val selectionModel = editor.selectionModel&#10;&#10;        if (selectionModel.hasSelection()) {&#10;            val selectedText = selectionModel.selectedText ?: return&#10;            WriteCommandAction.runWriteCommandAction(project) {&#10;                document.replaceString(&#10;                    selectionModel.selectionStart,&#10;                    selectionModel.selectionEnd,&#10;                    selectedText.uppercase()&#10;                )&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    override fun getActionUpdateThread(): ActionUpdateThread =&#10;        ActionUpdateThread.BGT&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class MyAction : AnAction() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun update(e: AnActionEvent) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val project = e.project</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val editor = e.getData(CommonDataKeys.EDITOR)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        e.presentation.isEnabledAndVisible = project != null &#x26;&#x26; editor != null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun actionPerformed(e: AnActionEvent) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val project = e.project ?: return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val editor = e.getData(CommonDataKeys.EDITOR) ?: return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val document = editor.document</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val selectionModel = editor.selectionModel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (selectionModel.hasSelection()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val selectedText = selectionModel.selectedText ?: return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            WriteCommandAction.runWriteCommandAction(project) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                document.replaceString(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    selectionModel.selectionStart,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    selectionModel.selectionEnd,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    selectedText.uppercase()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun getActionUpdateThread(): ActionUpdateThread =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ActionUpdateThread.BGT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>AnActionEvent</code> 提供了丰富的上下文信息，通过 <code>DataKey</code> 机制可以获取当前编辑器、文件、项目等对象。<code>getActionUpdateThread()</code> 指定 <code>update()</code> 在哪个线程执行——<code>BGT</code>（Background Thread）用于不涉及 UI 的计算，<code>EDT</code>（Event Dispatch Thread）用于需要读取 UI 状态的场景。</p>\n<p>Action 还支持<strong>分组</strong>（ActionGroup），可以创建动态子菜单：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class MyActionGroup : DefaultActionGroup() {&#10;    override fun update(e: AnActionEvent) {&#10;        e.presentation.isPopupGroup = true&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    override fun getChildren(e: AnActionEvent?): Array&lt;AnAction&gt; {&#10;        return arrayOf(&#10;            MyAction(),&#10;            Separator(),&#10;            AnotherAction()&#10;        )&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class MyActionGroup : DefaultActionGroup() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun update(e: AnActionEvent) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        e.presentation.isPopupGroup = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun getChildren(e: AnActionEvent?): Array&#x3C;AnAction> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return arrayOf(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            MyAction(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Separator(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            AnotherAction()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"线程模型与读写锁\">线程模型与读写锁</h2><p>IntelliJ Platform 的线程模型是插件开发中最关键的知识之一。平台使用<strong>读写锁</strong>（Read/Write Lock）保护内存中的数据模型：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>读操作</strong>（Read Action）：可以在任何线程执行，但必须在 <code>ReadAction</code> 上下文中</li>\n<li><strong>写操作</strong>（Write Action）：必须在 EDT（Event Dispatch Thread）上执行</li>\n<li><strong>UI 操作</strong>：必须在 EDT 上执行</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 读操作 — 后台线程安全读取&#10;ReadAction.run&lt;Throwable&gt; {&#10;    val psiFile = PsiManager.getInstance(project).findFile(virtualFile)&#10;    val classes = PsiTreeUtil.findChildrenOfType(psiFile, PsiClass::class.java)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 非阻塞读操作 — 推荐方式&#10;ReadAction.nonBlocking&lt;List&lt;PsiClass&gt;&gt; {&#10;    val psiFile = PsiManager.getInstance(project).findFile(virtualFile)&#10;    PsiTreeUtil.findChildrenOfType(psiFile, PsiClass::class.java).toList()&#10;}&#10;    .inSmartMode(project)&#10;    .finishOnUiThread(ModalityState.defaultModalityState()) { classes -&gt;&#10;        updateUI(classes)&#10;    }&#10;    .submit(AppExecutorUtil.getAppExecutorService())&#10;&#10;// 写操作 — 必须在 EDT&#10;WriteCommandAction.runWriteCommandAction(project) {&#10;    document.setText(&quot;new content&quot;)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 读操作 — 后台线程安全读取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ReadAction.run&#x3C;Throwable> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val psiFile = PsiManager.getInstance(project).findFile(virtualFile)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val classes = PsiTreeUtil.findChildrenOfType(psiFile, PsiClass::class.java)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 非阻塞读操作 — 推荐方式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ReadAction.nonBlocking&#x3C;List&#x3C;PsiClass>> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val psiFile = PsiManager.getInstance(project).findFile(virtualFile)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    PsiTreeUtil.findChildrenOfType(psiFile, PsiClass::class.java).toList()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .inSmartMode(project)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .finishOnUiThread(ModalityState.defaultModalityState()) { classes -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        updateUI(classes)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .submit(AppExecutorUtil.getAppExecutorService())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 写操作 — 必须在 EDT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WriteCommandAction.runWriteCommandAction(project) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    document.setText(\"new content\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作类型</th>\n<th>线程要求</th>\n<th>API</th>\n<th>是否可取消</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Read Action</td>\n<td>任意线程</td>\n<td><code>ReadAction.run {}</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Non-blocking Read</td>\n<td>后台线程</td>\n<td><code>ReadAction.nonBlocking {}</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Write Action</td>\n<td>EDT</td>\n<td><code>WriteCommandAction.run {}</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UI 更新</td>\n<td>EDT</td>\n<td><code>ApplicationManager.invokeLater {}</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后台任务</td>\n<td>后台线程</td>\n<td><code>ProgressManager.run(Task.Backgroundable)</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>ReadAction.nonBlocking</code> 是现代 IntelliJ 插件开发的推荐模式，它允许读操作在后台线程执行，当写操作到来时自动取消并重试，避免了传统 <code>ReadAction.run</code> 可能导致的 UI 冻结问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"gradle-构建与项目配置\">Gradle 构建与项目配置</h2><p>IntelliJ 插件使用 Gradle 构建系统，配合 <code>gradle-intellij-plugin</code>（现已升级为 IntelliJ Platform Gradle Plugin 2.x）管理依赖、沙箱测试和打包发布。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// build.gradle.kts&#10;plugins {&#10;    id(&quot;java&quot;)&#10;    id(&quot;org.jetbrains.kotlin.jvm&quot;) version &quot;1.9.24&quot;&#10;    id(&quot;org.jetbrains.intellij.platform&quot;) version &quot;2.0.0&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;repositories {&#10;    mavenCentral()&#10;    intellijPlatform {&#10;        defaultRepositories()&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;dependencies {&#10;    intellijPlatform {&#10;        intellijIdeaCommunity(&quot;2024.1&quot;)&#10;        bundledPlugin(&quot;com.intellij.java&quot;)&#10;        instrumentationTools()&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;intellijPlatform {&#10;    pluginConfiguration {&#10;        id = &quot;com.example.myplugin&quot;&#10;        name = &quot;My Plugin&quot;&#10;        version = &quot;1.0.0&quot;&#10;        ideaVersion {&#10;            sinceBuild = &quot;241&quot;&#10;            untilBuild = &quot;242.*&quot;&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;    sandboxContainer = layout.buildDirectory.dir(&quot;idea-sandbox&quot;)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// build.gradle.kts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>plugins {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    id(\"java\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    id(\"org.jetbrains.kotlin.jvm\") version \"1.9.24\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    id(\"org.jetbrains.intellij.platform\") version \"2.0.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>repositories {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mavenCentral()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    intellijPlatform {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        defaultRepositories()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dependencies {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    intellijPlatform {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        intellijIdeaCommunity(\"2024.1\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        bundledPlugin(\"com.intellij.java\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        instrumentationTools()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>intellijPlatform {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pluginConfiguration {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        id = \"com.example.myplugin\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        name = \"My Plugin\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        version = \"1.0.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ideaVersion {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            sinceBuild = \"241\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            untilBuild = \"242.*\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sandboxContainer = layout.buildDirectory.dir(\"idea-sandbox\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>sinceBuild</code> 和 <code>untilBuild</code> 定义了插件的兼容性范围。<code>241</code> 表示 2024.1 版本，<code>242.*</code> 表示兼容 2024.2 的所有补丁版本。合理设置兼容范围可以避免用户升级 IDE 后插件无法使用。</p>\n<p>Gradle 提供了以下关键任务：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"./gradlew runIde          # 启动沙箱 IDE 实例进行调试&#10;./gradlew buildPlugin     # 构建插件 ZIP 包&#10;./gradlew verifyPlugin    # 验证插件兼容性&#10;./gradlew publishPlugin   # 发布到 JetBrains Marketplace&#10;./gradlew test            # 运行插件测试\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">./gradlew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> runIde</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          # 启动沙箱 IDE 实例进行调试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">./gradlew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> buildPlugin</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">     # 构建插件 ZIP 包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">./gradlew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> verifyPlugin</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 验证插件兼容性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">./gradlew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> publishPlugin</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   # 发布到 JetBrains Marketplace</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">./gradlew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            # 运行插件测试</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[源代码] --&gt; B[Gradle 编译]&#10;    B --&gt; C[plugin.xml 处理]&#10;    C --&gt; D[字节码增强]&#10;    D --&gt; E[JAR 打包]&#10;    E --&gt; F[ZIP 分发包]&#10;    F --&gt; G{目标}&#10;    G --&gt;|调试| H[runIde 沙箱]&#10;    G --&gt;|测试| I[verifyPlugin]&#10;    G --&gt;|发布| J[Marketplace]\">flowchart LR\n    A[源代码] --&gt; B[Gradle 编译]\n    B --&gt; C[plugin.xml 处理]\n    C --&gt; D[字节码增强]\n    D --&gt; E[JAR 打包]\n    E --&gt; F[ZIP 分发包]\n    F --&gt; G{目标}\n    G --&gt;|调试| H[runIde 沙箱]\n    G --&gt;|测试| I[verifyPlugin]\n    G --&gt;|发布| J[Marketplace]</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((IntelliJ Platform))&#10;    声明式注册&#10;      plugin.xml&#10;      Extension Point&#10;      Action 注册&#10;    Service 体系&#10;      Application 级&#10;      Project 级&#10;      Module 级&#10;      Light Service&#10;    Action 系统&#10;      AnAction&#10;      ActionGroup&#10;      DataKey 上下文&#10;    线程模型&#10;      Read/Write Lock&#10;      NonBlocking Read&#10;      EDT 写操作&#10;    构建工具&#10;      Gradle&#10;      沙箱调试&#10;      兼容性管理\">mindmap\n  root((IntelliJ Platform))\n    声明式注册\n      plugin.xml\n      Extension Point\n      Action 注册\n    Service 体系\n      Application 级\n      Project 级\n      Module 级\n      Light Service\n    Action 系统\n      AnAction\n      ActionGroup\n      DataKey 上下文\n    线程模型\n      Read/Write Lock\n      NonBlocking Read\n      EDT 写操作\n    构建工具\n      Gradle\n      沙箱调试\n      兼容性管理</pre><ul>\n<li>IntelliJ Platform 采用<strong>组件-服务-扩展点</strong>三层架构，<code>plugin.xml</code> 是插件的核心配置入口</li>\n<li>Service 按作用域分为 Application、Project、Module 三级，轻量级 <code>@Service</code> 注解是推荐的注册方式</li>\n<li>Action 系统通过 <code>update()</code> 控制可见性、<code>actionPerformed()</code> 执行逻辑，支持分组和动态子菜单</li>\n<li>线程模型基于读写锁，<code>ReadAction.nonBlocking</code> 是避免 UI 冻结的推荐模式</li>\n<li>Gradle 构建系统管理依赖、沙箱测试和发布，<code>sinceBuild/untilBuild</code> 控制版本兼容性</li>\n<li>与 VS Code 相比，IntelliJ Platform 提供更深层的语言集成能力，但学习曲线也更陡峭</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"IntelliJ Platform 基础","id":"intellij-platform-基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"plugin.xml 与声明式注册","id":"plugin-xml-与声明式注册"},{"level":2,"text":"Service 体系与作用域","id":"service-体系与作用域"},{"level":2,"text":"Action 系统与用户交互","id":"action-系统与用户交互"},{"level":2,"text":"线程模型与读写锁","id":"线程模型与读写锁"},{"level":2,"text":"Gradle 构建与项目配置","id":"gradle-构建与项目配置"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"调试 UI 定制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/ide-extension-development/debugger-extension/debugging-ui"},"next":{"title":"PSI 与 AST 操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/ide-extension-development/jetbrains-plugin/psi-and-ast"}}